-- Adds the behavior_client_class rows the templates of the objects the server sends into a zone need, found by following each behavior name to the factory the r806919 client program registers for it: the class the factory builds where the type dump describes it, and an empty slot where the class is one the dump does not describe or no factory is registered at all.
ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE `class_name` = VALUES(`class_name`), `evidence` = VALUES(`evidence`);
